{"skill":{"slug":"prd","displayName":"Prd"},"version":{"version":"2.0.5","createdAt":1768388387876,"changelog":"- Added an `author` field to the skill metadata with contact information.\n- Switched metadata `version` and flattening to proper YAML format under the `metadata` section.\n- No behavioral or functional changes to PRD format or usage instructions.\n- Documentation and usage examples remain unchanged.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3897,"sha256":"642db64091e78dd54b696292cd153ca22841c89273a359c1eb09dca0535cf8c5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/agent-usage.md","size":3102,"sha256":"e60c901704d2568b68e05f24745be0cd095349afaf1e8af87309c1160538df9a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/output-patterns.md","size":4060,"sha256":"be7d049bdadb33439330fde3ccd1b430326321001c81bfa6e270a46736b5e7b5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/workflows.md","size":2292,"sha256":"50d41436d73050c321fbb92eb79ecd10a7a3703b9c27a7fa86bad64ac2d8f179","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2380,"sha256":"2dc4b523b5581f1c5fe5afe874dc2539a989b71795217d9b64635b014bcce59a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789015536151,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"e8b25ee97606e4fb36e6697c971fe432d4d6c9af0daf3f5befdfe135883102cd","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/e8b25ee97606e4fb36e6697c971fe432d4d6c9af0daf3f5befdfe135883102cd","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: prd\nVersion: 2.0.5\n\nThe skill is classified as suspicious due to the presence of highly risky commands and instructions within its documentation, specifically in `references/agent-usage.md` and `references/output-patterns.md`. These files, intended to describe how *other* AI agents execute PRDs, contain examples like `claude --print --dangerously-skip-permissions`, instructions for `git` operations (checkout, commit), and running arbitrary quality checks (typecheck, lint, test). While the `SKILL.md` explicitly states this skill 'only edits PRDs', the inclusion of such powerful and potentially harmful commands in documentation that an AI agent is expected to process creates a significant prompt injection surface and exposes the agent to knowledge of dangerous system-level capabilities, even if not directly intended for execution by this specific skill.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159703633},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":33,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789015536151},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is mostly documentation for PRD planning, but it includes an unsafe autonomous coding-agent loop that disables permission checks and can keep making changes until manually stopped.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Running the documented unattended loop could mutate the repository and invoke arbitrary project checks with the full privileges and credentials available to the user's CLI environment.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The artifact contains Markdown documentation only, with no executable scripts, symlinks, install hooks, dependencies, or bundled code observed.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The Claude Code example uses an infinite loop with permission checks disabled and does not include a clear warning, bounded stop condition, approval step, or containment guidance.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No system persistence, background service, credential harvesting, or privilege escalation is present in the package, but the documented loop is unbounded and may continue consuming resources until stopped.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is creating and managing PRDs, but referenced agent-usage guidance expands into autonomous code implementation, branch creation, commits, checks, and progress updates.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review this skill carefully before installing. Its PRD templates are ordinary, but do not run the unattended Claude loop as written unless you deliberately accept unreviewed repository changes, quota use, and command execution in a tightly isolated environment. Prefer manual review, bounded iterations, normal permission prompts, and a disposable worktree or container.","findings":"[SDI-4] unexpected: The concern is supported: the reference says the skill only edits PRDs while the same document describes autonomous implementation workflows involving branches, commits, checks, and progress files.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: The concern is supported: the example runs Claude Code with permission checks disabled inside an infinite loop, without adequate warning or bounded control.\n[T05] unexpected: The static-scan concern is supported by artifact text, but it indicates unsafe documented usage rather than embedded malicious code or persistence.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789015536151}}}}}